        "start": 331,
        "text": "Your chat's running joke is now the boss.",
        "duration": 4
      },
      {
        "start": 239,
        "text": "Lore Boss turns repeated Twitch chat into a game. This is a real solo rehearsal. The model proposes a quote from two stored messages. A moderator inspects the exact evidence before anything reaches the overlay.",
        "duration": 15
      },
      {
        "start": 257,
        "text": "Approval stays human. Only approved lore powers the boss. The proposal becomes a quote attack, credited to the chatter who said it.",
        "duration": 11
      },
      {
        "start": 309,
        "text": "Spawn the boss, and chat takes over. The overlay and native Twitch chat are recorded together, with no separate chat track.",
        "duration": 9
      },
      {
        "start": 318,
        "text": "The approved line is now the boss's quote attack. Chat can attack, heal, or block. A lore strike is about to charge.",
        "duration": 11
